; Inline tests built with `(modes ... js)` are run by js_of_ocaml through node.
; Without this they would attach to the `runtest` alias, so every `dune runtest`
; and `make runtest` would start linking js_of_ocaml and shelling out to node --
; the same cost `make jsoo.runtest` is deliberately kept out of `runtest` to
; avoid. Routing them to their own alias keeps `dune runtest` native-only and
; makes `dune build @runtest-js` the single entry point for the JS side, which
; is what `make jsoo.inline-runtest` drives.
;
; See the `.ai/` js backends design.

(env
 (_
  (js_of_ocaml
   (runtest_alias runtest-js))))
